<section image-layout="blank" id="wxmMrlIVmL"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="m50kqibFy8"><p role="eyebrow">Operating standard</p><h1 font-size="38pt">Buy back minutes before buying more machine</h1><h3 role="subheading">First ask: which lost minute is cheapest to eliminate?</h3><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-gap:0.6em"><grid-item colspan="12"><h3>Measure</h3><p font-size="18pt">Record effective ha/hour in real field conditions.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="12"><h3>Separate</h3><p font-size="18pt">Split turning, waiting, adjustment and stoppage minutes.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="12"><h3>Compare</h3><p font-size="18pt">Test viable systems in work-window hours and cost/ha.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="12"><h3>Improve first</h3><p font-size="18pt">Fix routing, logistics, calibration and maintenance.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="12"><h3>Remeasure</h3><p font-size="18pt">Check cost and work quality, then return to step 01.</p></grid-item></grid><grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item background-color="accent" padding="18pt" vertical-align="center" colspan="16"><p role="eyebrow">Decision gate</p><h2>ADD CAPACITY?</h2></grid-item><grid-item background-color="surface" padding="18pt 22pt" colspan="44"><h3>Add capacity only if verified residual hours still miss the work window.</h3><p>Power, hitch, soil load, access, work quality and total cost must also remain acceptable.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>